        "created_at": "2017-08-04T19:29:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, given that \"To Hope for the Dawn\" says \"Flip this card and put it in your hand\", while F.I.L.T.E.R. Heist, Demands of the Gods, and Time and Time Again only say \"Flip this card\", I'm guessing that some go immediately into play and others go into your hand, and possibly others have other effects.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Interestingly, since the cards don't say anything about putting the card in front of you I can only assume that the Missions are given to specific heroes rather than being open for anyone to complete.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:29:24.599Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
