        "created_at": "2017-08-04T21:01:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Forget Expatriette, I want to see Mr. Fixer attach it to his Jack Handle!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I had a thought.</p>\n<p>Jack Handle with the Ennead power and a boatload of targets.</p>\n<p>With Alternating Tiger Claw.</p>",
